<title>UK: Unilever buys rest of Choky's French parent.</title>
<headline>Unilever buys rest of Choky's French parent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch consumer goods group Unilever said on Friday its French unit had bought the outstanding 49 percent stake in Jerome SA, which owns soft drink marketer Choky SA.</p>
</text>
